	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02r0701_dancer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でんこうけいじばん　みてる？▼
たいりょうはっせいした　ポケモンの
ニュースが　いま　あついんだダヨ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電光掲示板　みてる？▼
大量発生した　ポケモンの
ニュースが　いま　熱いんだダヨ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・swanで追加
・元はr13r0201にいた動作モデル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DANCER</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02r0701_girl1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねぇねぇ　きみ▼
あそぶなら
いえのそと　か　いえのなか▽
どっちが　すき？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねぇねぇ　きみ▼
遊ぶなら　家の外と　家の中
どっちが　好き？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
